[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（……よし。それじゃ、任務開始といこうかな！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(All right. Time to get this mission started!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（怪しそうな人は――）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Now to find someone suspicious...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（――いた！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(There!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さあお嬢様がた、焦らず店の外へ。\n大丈夫、俺がついているからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Easy now, ladies. Let's get you outside. Don't worry—you're in good hands with me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "永遠！\u3000見つけた！\u3000あっち！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa! Found him! Over there!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tch!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おやおや、そっちは出口と反対だよ。\n急急如律令！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My, my, that's the wrong way. The exit's back there. Jiujiurulüling!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よし！\u3000これでどこへ逃げても追いかけられる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Perfect! Now I can track him wherever he runs."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鬼門！\u3000煙もう大丈夫！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon! The smoke's all clear!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "御意！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Understood!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "作戦は上手くいったようね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Looks like the plan worked."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000あっちへ一人逃げていった！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! Someone ran off that way!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも……その先は壁みたいだけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But... it looks like there's just a wall ahead."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、あれ……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だが、式神の反応はこの先を示している。\nもしや隠し通路か！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But my shikigami's reaction points straight ahead. Could there be a hidden passage?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "い、いつの間に……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wh-when did you...?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "むう、コウセンのようなことを……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Most ninja-like...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……確かに！\u3000この先、空洞になってるみたい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're right! There's a hollow space beyond this!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どういう仕掛けなのかしら。首輪を付けている\nとはいえ、早く追いかけたいところだけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wonder how the mechanism works. Even with the collars on, I'd like to give chase..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前たち！\u3000まだ中にいたのか！\n早く外へ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You lot! Still inside?! Get out, now..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "か、鏑矢様！\u3000ええと、これは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "M-Master Kaburaya! Um, this is..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……お前たち、いったい何をしている？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...What exactly are you all doing here?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "心配はいらない、とだけ言っておこうかな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's just say there's nothing to worry about."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなた、この二人のご主人様ね？\nごめんなさい、部下をお借りしてしまって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're their master, I take it? My apologies for borrowing your subordinates."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ふむ。何か企んでいるようだな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I see. Scheming something, are we?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ごめん、細かい話は後で！\nアタシたち、この壁の向こうに行かないといけなくて！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sorry, no time for details! We need to get through this wall!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分かった。ならば手を貸そう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Understood. Then allow me to assist."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はああああっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haaaah!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こんなものでよいか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Will this suffice?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら素敵",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How lovely."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うわ……無茶苦茶やるわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow... That's intense."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さすが鏑矢さん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's Kaburaya for you..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それじゃあ、追いかけましょう。\nこの事件の「黒幕」を",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well then, let's go after them. Time to catch the mastermind behind all this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]